{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778976607276,"sessionID":"ses_1ccbdeaffffe8wyNP65E30kwI5","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_grptYPyS0uZuof7HuNWpva6w","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+Added `fasciacyte` as a new CL term in the local commit for PR #<NN>.\n*** Add File: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n+This PR addresses issue #3497 by adding a new CL term for `fasciacyte`.\n+\n+Changes made:\n+\n+- Added `CL_9900001` with label `fasciacyte`.\n+- Added a textual definition based on the issue request and cited literature.\n+- Added definition xrefs for `PMID:29575206` and `PMID:33573365`.\n+- Classified the term under the requested parent, `CL_0000499` (`stromal cell`).\n+- Added a capability axiom for `hyaluronan biosynthetic process` (`RO_0002215 some GO_0030213`) to capture the hyaluronan-rich ECM biosynthesis specialization.\n+- Added the requested contributor ORCID, `https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5507-2103`.\n+- Added `terms:creator`, `terms:date`, and an issue tracker annotation for issue #3497.\n+\n+Review notes:\n+\n+- I checked that no `fasciacyte` term already existed in `src/ontology/cl-edit.owl`.\n+- I checked the requested parent `CL_0000499` and existing stromal/fibroblast patterns for consistency.\n+- I checked the cited PMID pages on PubMed. The repository helper `aurelian fulltext` was not available in this environment, so fulltext retrieval via that command could not be performed.\n+- I did not add a `part_of` fascia axiom because `src/ontology/cl-edit.owl` did not contain a fascia UBERON class declaration or existing fascia axiom to reuse safely.\n+\n+Validation:\n+\n+- `robot convert --input src/ontology/cl-edit.owl --output /tmp/opencode/cl-edit-test.owl` completed successfully.\n+\n+Checklist:\n+\n+- [x] Read imported issue context.\n+- [x] Checked for an existing term.\n+- [x] Checked requested parent term.\n+- [x] Added definition with references.\n+- [x] Added contributor ORCID and creation metadata.\n+- [x] Added logical capability axiom for hyaluronan biosynthesis.\n+- [x] Validated OWL functional syntax conversion.\n+\n+GitHub Copilot\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\nA PR_COMMENTS.md","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,1 @@\n+Added `fasciacyte` as a new CL term in the local commit for PR #<NN>.\n\nIndex: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,34 @@\n+This PR addresses issue #3497 by adding a new CL term for `fasciacyte`.\n+\n+Changes made:\n+\n+- Added `CL_9900001` with label `fasciacyte`.\n+- Added a textual definition based on the issue request and cited literature.\n+- Added definition xrefs for `PMID:29575206` and `PMID:33573365`.\n+- Classified the term under the requested parent, `CL_0000499` (`stromal cell`).\n+- Added a capability axiom for `hyaluronan biosynthetic process` (`RO_0002215 some GO_0030213`) to capture the hyaluronan-rich ECM biosynthesis specialization.\n+- Added the requested contributor ORCID, `https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5507-2103`.\n+- Added `terms:creator`, `terms:date`, and an issue tracker annotation for issue #3497.\n+\n+Review notes:\n+\n+- I checked that no `fasciacyte` term already existed in `src/ontology/cl-edit.owl`.\n+- I checked the requested parent `CL_0000499` and existing stromal/fibroblast patterns for consistency.\n+- I checked the cited PMID pages on PubMed. The repository helper `a